#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:1 82474230cf21467cb6bbce19c0c708b8
msgid "Identifier"
msgstr "标识符"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:3 8c1da3e23c40401c9bc41f1aac415aed
msgid ""
"When reading `TDigiEvent`, the `m_intId` field in `mdc`, `tof`, `emc`, "
"`muc`, and `cgem` branches represents the electronics readout ID (TEID), "
"also known as `Identifier` in `BOSS`. Pybes3 provides methods to parse "
"and calculate the identifier for each detector."
msgstr ""
"读取 `TDigiEvent` 时，`mdc`、`tof`、`emc`、`muc` 与 `cgem` branch 中的 `m_intId` "
"字段表示电子学读出 ID（TEID），即 `BOSS` 中的 `Identifier`。Pybes3 提供了各探测器的标识符解析与计算方法。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:5 99002823eb1740e787d873b2b7881fe4
msgid "Identifier array parsing"
msgstr "标识符数组解析"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:18 fe33fc68f6d941e3a1903f804ce033ae
msgid "Standalone identifier parsing"
msgstr "单独解析标识符"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:20 f730cbd7d9d34fe0b0b4c18bb0e3b3ba
msgid ""
"When full identifier array parsing is not necessary or not yet supported,"
" use `parse_xxx_id` methods (where `xxx` is the detector name: `cgem`, "
"`mdc`, `tof`, `emc`, `muc`) to parse only the identifier:"
msgstr ""
"当不需要或尚不支持完整的标识符数组解析时，可用 `parse_xxx_id` 方法（`xxx` "
"为探测器名：`cgem`、`mdc`、`tof`、`emc`、`muc`）只解析标识符："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:36 a1b9997fd84f4726b432d0534e7debbd
msgid ""
"`parse_mdc_id` and `parse_emc_id` currently return detector ID-related "
"fields only."
msgstr "`parse_mdc_id` 与 `parse_emc_id` 目前只返回与探测器 ID 相关的字段。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:39 1b5fbe55267246a08750b262e60d1955
msgid "Convert identifier to a specific field"
msgstr "把标识符转换为指定字段"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:54 55e91d107f704eb291faf17ef8969955
msgid ""
"See the [Identifier API](../api/pybes3.identifier.md) for all available "
"methods."
msgstr "全部可用方法见[标识符 API](../api/pybes3.identifier.md)。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:56 f0b7bc2b947246e49ebd3fe78c77b3db
msgid "Identifier calculation"
msgstr "标识符计算"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:58 839b018194d043818d5cf9969e5da52e
msgid ""
"To compute `m_intId` from geometry numbers, use `get_xxx_id` methods "
"(where `xxx` is the detector name: `cgem`, `mdc`, `tof`, `emc`, `muc`):"
msgstr ""
"要由几何编号计算 `m_intId`，可用 `get_xxx_id` 方法（`xxx` "
"为探测器名：`cgem`、`mdc`、`tof`、`emc`、`muc`）："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:74 a9dbb61bc8ca4aed9d510102f54841e2
msgid "Pybes3 uses a different convention for the TOF `part` number:"
msgstr "Pybes3 对 TOF 的 `part` 编号采用不同的约定："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:76 8047a2bd2f954dda8f4b2489c7698435
msgid "`0`, `1`, `2` for scintillator endcap 0, barrel, and endcap 1"
msgstr "`0`、`1`、`2` 分别表示闪烁体端盖 0、桶部、端盖 1"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:77 9c69e95f9ed94be79c6daf18e07321cf
msgid "`3`, `4` for MRPC endcap 0 and endcap 1"
msgstr "`3`、`4` 分别表示 MRPC 端盖 0 与端盖 1"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/identifier.md:79 2b07cf54aff94ada8c8a0bef887f7b2a
msgid ""
"With this convention, TOF ID information can be decoded into 4 fields: "
"`part`, `layer_or_module`, `phi_or_strip`, and `end`."
msgstr "按此约定，TOF ID 信息可以解码为 4 个字段：`part`、`layer_or_module`、`phi_or_strip` 与 `end`。"

